      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "HWP The Property specialists are delighted to bring this three bed home to the lucan market. This property is situated in Hansted Way, a prestigious development located in lucan. No. 38 is sure to attract interest from buyers across the market. Excellent BER Rating B with approximately circa 900sq ft accommodation . \n\n The property comprises of a large entrance hallway, leading to a reception room, which then leads on to an open plan kitchen. To the rear is a private sunny garden. On the ground floor there is a guest bathroom.\n\n There are two large spacious double bedrooms with built in wardrobes. The master bedroom has spacious wardrobes and plenty of storage with an ensuite bathroom. There is also another generous sized bedroom. The main family bathroom is on this floor. \n\nThere is huge potential to extend and upgrade this house, and the property offers a blank canvas to put your own stamp. There is a driveway to the front.\n\nHansted Way is located close to Lucan Village and Adamstown with every imaginable amenity on your doorstep. The location is truly next to none. Within a stone?s throw you will find local bars, shops, schools, parks and recreational facilities along with a host of bus routes, the N4 & M50 road network and also Adamstown Train station with its direct links to Heuston station and beyond. \n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment only.\n"
